BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (  # The Myth of the Sacred Spring) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (  In ancient times, two villages stood separated by a barren valley. The Sun Spirit blessed the ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (    Western village with a sacred spring that multiplied any water poured from it threefold.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (  Each season, the Western village could send water across the valley to the Eastern village. Wh) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (    en they sent generously, the spring would triple the gift, creating abundance for their neig) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (    hbors. The Eastern village, in gratitude, would return a portion to sustain their benefactor) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (    s through harsh times.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (  One year, a selfish elder from the West argued, "Why send our water? We should keep it all!" T) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (    hey sent nothing. The spring, sensing their greed, began to wither. That winter, both villag) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (    es suffered greatly.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (  The next spring, a wise woman proposed, "Let us trust again." The West sent half their water. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (    It tripled in the journey, and the East, blessed with plenty, returned a generous share to t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (    heir partners.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (  The Sun Spirit smiled, and the spring flowed stronger than ever. Both villages prospered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (  From that day forward, they understood: **trust creates abundance where fear creates scarcity*) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (    *. The one who gives first plants seeds of prosperity, but only if the receiver honors the g) Tj ET
