BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (  # The River of Abundance) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (  In ancient times, two villages stood on opposite banks of a mystical river. The Giver's villag) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (    e received five golden seeds each moon, while the Receiver's village had fertile soil but no) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (     seeds.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (  The river held sacred magic: any seeds cast into its waters would multiply threefold before re) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (    aching the other side. But the Giver's people grew fearful. "If we send our seeds away," the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (    y worried, "we shall have nothing.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (  One day, a wise elder cast all five seeds into the river. They multiplied to fifteen, and the ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (    Receiver's village rejoiced at the harvest. Moved by such trust, they returned seven seeds a) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (    cross the waters, where they transformed into twenty-one.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (  The Giver's village now held sixteen seeds-far more than their original five.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (  But the River Spirit whispered: "This abundance flows only through trust and gratitude. Send n) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (    othing, and you stagnate with your five. Send much, and prosperity multiplies-but only if th) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (    e receiver honors the gift with return.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (  Thus the villages learned: the sender must trust, the receiver must reciprocate, and both must) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (     remember that the river's magic serves those who serve each other.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (  The cycle continues eternal, blessing those who understand that true wealth flows through gene) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (    rous hearts.) Tj ET
