BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages stood on opposite banks of a mystical river. The Giver's vi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (        llage received five golden seeds each moon, while the Receiver's village had fertile soi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (        l but no seeds.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (      The river held sacred magic: any seeds cast into its waters would multiply threefold befor) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (        e reaching the other side. But the Giver's people grew fearful. "If we send our seeds aw) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (        ay," they worried, "we shall have nothing.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      One day, a wise elder cast all five seeds into the river. They multiplied to fifteen, and ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (        the Receiver's village rejoiced at the harvest. Moved by such trust, they returned seven) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (         seeds across the waters, where they transformed into twenty-one.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      The Giver's village now held sixteen seeds-far more than their original five.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      But the River Spirit whispered: "This abundance flows only through trust and gratitude. Se) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (        nd nothing, and you stagnate with your five. Send much, and prosperity multiplies-but on) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (        ly if the receiver honors the gift with return.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      Thus the villages learned: the sender must trust, the receiver must reciprocate, and both ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (        must remember that the river's magic serves those who serve each other.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
