BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (        are to their partners.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      The Sun Spirit smiled, and the spring flowed stronger than ever. Both villages prospered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      From that day forward, they understood: **trust creates abundance where fear creates scarc) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (        ity**. The one who gives first plants seeds of prosperity, but only if the receiver hono) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (        rs the gift with fair return. Together, they thrive; divided, they wither.) Tj ET
