BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      In ancient times, two villages stood on opposite banks of a mystical river. The Giver's vi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (        llage received five golden seeds each moon, while the Receiver's village had fertile soi) Tj ET
